士一同幫忙。\n\n林○蘭女士本是一位熱衷於美食料理的饌研者，在不影響原本日式風味的前題下，用所學技術將日式拉麵改良成較適合台灣民眾的口味，成功的讓愛好拉麵的饕客讚賞與肯定，並擁有了越來越多愛好者。\n\n_訊息來源：FaceBook粉專\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n叉燒入口即化的口感 超美味\n可惜炸雞有點沒入味 吃起來口感也偏柴\n店內環境的油煙味道也稍重..\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n■○ 日本富士八峰拉麵 ”竹圍民生店 □●\n地址：新北市淡水區民生路52巷2弄3號",null,[0,10]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTJMVTVVY0ROM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTJMVTVVY0ROM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTJMVTVVY0ROM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTJMVTVVY0ROM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTJMVTVVY0ROM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTJMVTVVY0ROM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,7834,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM2LU5UcDN3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x51877b4cf2748778!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC6-NTp3wE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM2LU5UcDN3RRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM2LU5UcDN3RRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM2LU5UcFB3EhNDZ3dJNWRXemlRWVEtSlNxa2dFGi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQzYtTlRwdndFEhNDZ3dJNWRXemlRWVEtSlNxa2dFIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAReId08kx7h1EqCzBXQURmX2VodFRz\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwi-4e3Y8NSWAxU2e_UHHe7OFAcQoykIlQEoCw"],null,[null,[[1,2]]]],"0ahUKEwjy5fXY8NSWAx