,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["點拉麵外帶，回家打開發現麵裡夾帶一根頭髮，打電話給老闆告知此事，老闆的態度一副不以為然的樣子，也沒有任何歉意，只是冷淡的說：「你可以拿回來我換一包麵給你」\n\n因當時趕著前往他處，所以我無法返回換麵。其實本來沒有要特別計較此事，如果老闆能真心的道歉或至少說句「不好意思」我也就覺得算了~可惜老闆的態度讓人完全無法接受\n\n這件事反應了一些問題：1.此店在餐點製作上衛生管理不佳 2.老闆對於讓客人吃到不衛生的餐點毫不在乎……是否反應了「餐點出問題」對老闆來說已是家常便飯？\n\n麵裡面有頭髮是其次，真正讓人不敢恭維的，是這種對於客人用餐的衛生安全滿不在乎的態度！很令人失望！\n\n以富士這樣的價位，在竹圍有至少其他2~3間更好吃、料更多、更用心製作、服務態度更好的拉麵店家可以選擇！各位竹圍人，可以多參考其他拉麵店家\n\n做餐飲，餐點衛生是最基本的，如果連這麼基本的事情都不重視，真的愧對上門的客人！",null,[0,157]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm9hWFZJUlVOUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm9hWFZJUlVOUkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm9hWFZJUlVOUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm9hWFZJUlVOUkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm9hWFZJUlVOUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm9hWFZJUlVOUkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,7196,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoaXVIRUNREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x51877b4cf2748778!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDhiuHECQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoaXVIRUNREAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoaXVIRUNREi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRGhpdUhFaVFFEhNDZ3dJLTR5Vm9BWVE4TVRXeHdNGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRGhpdUhFU1ESE0Nnd0ktNHlWb0FZUThNVFd4d00iEgkAAAAAAAAAABF4h3TyTHuHUSoLMFowSk92c3hQOGs\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwi-4