餐時間\n後續的客人陸陸續續的進來\n點餐後的菜單不斷地往廚房裡面送\n廚房開始製作餐點的時候\n同時間也會製造很多油煙出來\n所以我們邊吃邊感受到廚房飄出來的油煙...\n吃到後來我整個心情很煩躁\n急急忙忙的就想要走\n\n這次我們點了\n北海道赤味噌拉麵\n黃金豬排拉麵\n日式芙蓉豆腐\n這裡的湯頭喝起來還蠻好喝的\n這裡的黃金豬排\n不是想像中的日式豬排飯的豬排\n這裡的豬排很薄肉很少\n外面的麵包粉吸附了滿滿的油\n而且上面的醬汁吃起來幾乎沒有什麼味道\n旁邊也沒有多附一點醬汁讓客人沾\n就這麼少的醬汁淋在豬排上面\n完全感覺不出來再吃什麼\n只感覺的到口中滿滿的油...\n每一碗的拉麵裡面都有一顆完整的糖心蛋\n但是其他的配料就沒什麼感覺\n第一次在拉麵裡面吃到高麗菜...\n還有這裡可以免費把麵加大\n以價位的cp值來說還可以\n以餐點的品質有點差強人意...\n用餐環境還可以\n但是店內空氣很糟糕...\n吃完全身都是油煙味...\n\n( °-° )",null,[0,49]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTXRPR04xTlhCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTXRPR04xTlhCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTXRPR04xTlhCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTXRPR04xTlhCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTXRPR04xTlhCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5844386105418045979/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTXRPR04xTlhCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,6181,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMtOGN1NXBnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x51877b4cf2748778!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC-8cu5pgE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMtOGN1NXBnRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMtOGN1NXBnRRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMtOGN1NVpnEhNDZ3dJOHJTaG13WVFpSWVkNWdFGi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQy04Y3U1NWdFEhNDZ3dJNlp5aG13WVEyS0dVeVFJIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAReId08kx7h1EqCzBZUDRkbVJsb0Q3\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,n